&lt;p&gt;Biography
Xinyi, Zhang received her B.Eng degree in Electrical Engineering from Zhejiang University (ZJU) in 2021. She is currently pursuing the Ph.D. degree with the Department of Computer Science and Engineering, The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (supervised by Prof. Qian Zhang). Her research interests include smart health, wearable computing, Artificial Intelligence of Things (AIoT), and HCI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
